{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>But was not on the road.</b> Or: was not on the road — an instance like 'strikes his father and mother.'" "<b>And refrains from making the Passover.</b> From making the Passover, so that one says: here it has a substitute. An instance like 'and they refrained from building the city,' 'which Elohim created to do' — interpretation: for in it He rested from making all His work which He created."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:10.210280269Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}